        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Saka 6.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore te siadi ena nadol ilmalaika oong'uan eitashe too lubot pokira ong'uan e nkop, eibooyo isiwuon pokira oong'uan le nkop, pee meitoki olkutati akutu te nkop aashu te naiposha aashu akutaki olchani ake pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki adol likae malaika eilepu te nkilepunoto e nkolong, neeta olmishire le Enkai naishu, neipot to ltoilo sapuk lelo malaika oong'uan ooishooki engolon meinyiala enkop o enaiposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 9.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki, “Eminyial enkop aashu enaiposha aashu ilkeek, o metaba anaa nikimishir isinkan le Enkai ang inkomomi enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naning esiana, e lelo ootimishiraki; naa nkalifuni iip artam o oong'uan ilootimishiraki eing'uaa iloshon pooki loo layiok le Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Ruben, inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Gad, inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Asheri. Inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Naftali. Inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Simion, inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Lawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inkalifuni tomon o aare ilo losho le Isaakar naa nkalifuni tomon o aare ilootimishiraki eing'uaa olosho le Sebulon, nkalifuni tomon aare ilo losho le Yosef, nkalifuni tomon oare ilootimishiraki to losho le Benchamen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esiamo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ena, naing'orisho, naa ng'ura, olorora kitok lemeeta oltung'ani oidim aikena, eing'uaa pooki orere, neing'uaa loshon pooki, o ltung'ana o lng'ejepa, eitashe te dukuya olorika le nkitoo o te dukuya ilo Kuoo le Ker, neishopito ilkilani naaibor, neibung'ita ilng'osil loo ltuka too nkaik enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuaku to ltoilo sapuk aajo, “Ene Enkai ang enjeunoto: ina natonita to lorika le nkitoo o ene ilo Kuoo le Ker.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe ilmalaika pooki aaman olorika le nkitoo o lelo payiani o nena ng'uesi ong'uan naaishu, nebatata too nkomomi enye te dukuya ilo orika le nkitoo neserem Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejoito, “Esai, metaa emayianata o enkisisa o enkitoo, o eng'eno nagut o enkishooroto enashe o enkanyit o engolon o enkidimata ena Enkai ang intarasi o ntarasi. Esai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaitoki obo le lelo payiani airorie nanu ajoki, “Kakua kulo, ooishop ilkilani ooibor, naa kaji eing'uaa ninche?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 13.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Najoki nanu ninye, “Olkitok, iyiolo iyie.” Naaitoki aajoki, “Kulo ninche lelo ooiturukutuo aaing'uaa ilo sina kitok neitukuo ilkilani lenye neiborrie to sarge lo Lkuoo le Ker.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa enkaraki ina pee etii dukuya olorika le nkitoo le Enkai neisiaai ninye dama o kewarie ti atua enkaji enye, ore ilo otonita to lorika le nkitoo naa keitushur ninche te ine netii ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 49.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nemeitoki ae kata ninche aaisumashu aashu aatum enkure. Nemedal enkolong ninche aashu ae kirowuaj napejisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
